// Runnable:
//   ✅ Fire-and-forget: logging, notifications, cleanup
//   ✅ Thread constructor: new Thread(runnable)
//   ✅ execute() method
//   ✅ When result is not needed
//
// Callable:
//   ✅ Need return value: calculations, DB queries, API calls
//   ✅ Need checked exception propagation
//   ✅ submit() → Future → get result later
//   ✅ invokeAll() / invokeAny() for batch operations

